          "theme": "people_family",
          "text": "My family and friends are together today. My aunt makes cake. Every child needs a pencil. The children are playing outside. I help Dad wash the car. Daddy, please read this story. Our family goes to the park. Amy is my best friend. Uncle visits us on Sunday. After reading, we choose two new words and make our own sentences.",
