          "title": "Numbers and Time: Second Reading",
          "type": "guided-reading",
          "theme": "numbers_time",
          "text": "It is a busy day, and we check the time carefully. A worker wears a yellow hat. Morning is time for breakfast. Lunch starts at twelve o'clock. The movie starts at three p.m. We start our homework after dinner. Yesterday was rainy. Zero birds are in the tree. After reading, we choose two new words and make our own sentences.",
