          "type": "guided-reading",
          "theme": "body_health",
          "text": "We are learning how our bodies feel and move. The water feels warm. My hair is black. I wash my hand before lunch. My head hurts today. The hungry dog eats rice. My bag is heavy. There is a piece of chalk by the board. After reading, we choose two new words and make our own sentences.",
